          </p>

          <!-- ── IMAGE SLOT — QR Code ─────────────────────────────────────
               File: /images/qr-code.png   |   Size: 80 × 80 px
               Should be a real QR linking to your app / website
          ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
